@startuml
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1f2937
skinparam ArrowColor #5b6b8c
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1f2937
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam PackageBorderColor #94a3b8
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam ClassBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam ClassFontColor #1f2937
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam StateBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam StateFontColor #1f2937
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #eef2fb
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #5b6b8c
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fef3c7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #d97706
skinparam NoteFontColor #1f2937
' Exactly 8 business transitions: SRS section 3.6, FR-23/24, BR-08
' Payment lifecycle (PaymentStatus) is drawn below the order states; EXPIRED is not a PaymentStatus value.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
title BrewLite A2 — Order state machine (8 valid transitions) and Payment lifecycle

state PENDING
state PAID
state PAYMENT_FAILED #FCE8E5
state PREPARING
state READY
state COMPLETED #DFF1E5
state CANCELLED #EAEAEA

[*] --> PENDING : POST /orders creates order
PENDING --> PAID : IPN / QueryDR confirms payment (Payment SUCCESS)
PENDING --> PAYMENT_FAILED : IPN / QueryDR confirms failure (Payment FAILED)
PENDING --> CANCELLED : Customer cancellation [FR-25 Must]
PAYMENT_FAILED --> PENDING : retry payment (new Payment PENDING, same Order)
PAYMENT_FAILED --> CANCELLED : Customer cancellation [FR-25 Must]
PAID --> PREPARING : Barista
PREPARING --> READY : Barista
READY --> COMPLETED : Barista
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  New orders reserve ingredients and snapshot atomically.
  Order stays PENDING while it waits for VNPay: Payment PENDING
  (15 min), and past expiry until QueryDR concludes (E11).
  Failure keeps onHand / reserved and snapshot.
  Cancel is blocked (409 PAYMENT_IN_PROGRESS) while a Payment
  PENDING is still valid, or past expiry but not yet reconciled.
end note
note left of PAID
  First confirmed success (IPN or QueryDR) consumes the snapshot:
  decrease onHand + reserved, once. Replay returns cached SUCCESS;
  repeated IPN gets 02; no further consumption.
end note
note right of PAID
  PAID -> CANCELLED is NOT allowed in A2.
  FR-26 is Won't; reject with
  409 INVALID_ORDER_TRANSITION.
end note
note bottom of CANCELLED
  Owner unpaid cancellation releases reserved by snapshot once.
  onHand unchanged; repeated cancel rejected.
  Legacy false marker restores original Product.stock.
  A Payment turning FAILED does not release ingredients.
end note

state "Payment lifecycle (PaymentStatus)" as PaymentLifecycle {
  state "PENDING" as PAY_PENDING
  state "SUCCESS" as PAY_SUCCESS #DFF1E5
  state "FAILED" as PAY_FAILED #FCE8E5

  [*] --> PAY_PENDING : POST /payments signs URL (at most one per Order, BR-10)
  PAY_PENDING --> PAY_SUCCESS : IPN or QueryDR 00/00 (verified)
  PAY_PENDING --> PAY_FAILED : IPN or QueryDR final failure
  PAY_SUCCESS --> [*]
  PAY_FAILED --> [*]
}

note right of PAY_PENDING
  Return URL never changes the status (BR-11).
  Past expiresAt the Payment is still PENDING until QueryDR concludes.
  QueryDR 00/01 after expiry keeps PENDING; the exit route for
  abandoned payments is decided after the spike (chờ spike).
end note
note right of PAY_FAILED
  IPN counts as failed when vnp_TransactionStatus = 02,
  including a customer Cancel (24) (chờ spike).
  QueryDR 91 after expiry: FAILED with gatewayResponseCode = "EXPIRED"
  (chờ spike). EXPIRED is not a PaymentStatus value.
  Money arriving after a final state: IPN 02 + warning
  PAYMENT_RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED; Order and stock unchanged.
end note
note bottom of PaymentLifecycle
  Order.status follows the Payment: SUCCESS -> PAID,
  FAILED -> PAYMENT_FAILED. A retry creates a new Payment PENDING.
end note
@enduml
